I wrote a handler to decrement book stock when an order is placed. Can you review it?
```java
@On(entity = Books_.class)
public void onOrderBook(CdsUpdateEventContext context) {
    String bookId = (String) context.getCqn().ref().segments().get(0).keys().get("ID");
    Result res = db.run(Select.from(Books_.class).where(b -> b.ID().eq(bookId)));
    Books book = res.single(Books.class);
    int newStock = book.getStock() - 1;
    db.run(Update.entity(Books_.class).where(b -> b.ID().eq(bookId)).data(Books.STOCK, newStock));
}
```

